__label__booksmy family and other animals bbc radio 4 full cast dramatization book description celia imrie and toby jones star in this bbc radio 4 dramatisation of gerald durrell's classic story about his family's life in pre war corfu the specially created soundtrack takes the story out of the studio and into the greek wilderness that enthralled durrell the young naturalist 				 	 					 about the author gerald durrell obe 1925 1995 was an english naturalist zookeeper conservationist author and television presenter he founded what is now called the durrell wildlife conservation trust and the jersey zoo now durrell wildlife park on the channel island of jersey in 1958 but is perhaps best remembered for writing a number of books based on his life as an animal collector and enthusiast he was the youngest brother of novelist lawrence durrell source wikipedia
